{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10284050","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10284050","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1028405001:1":{"text":"うーん……この木は全部、最近切られたもののようですね。痕跡が新しくて、木くずも落ちてます。","source_cn":"嗯……这些树都是这几天砍掉的，痕迹很新，还有木屑呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3D3415E01460A56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1028405002:1":{"text":"このノコギリの痕跡を見る限り、私たちが普段使ってる伐採道具のようですね。まさか、本当に採集部隊がやったのでしょうか？","source_cn":"看这锯痕，确实像是我们常用的伐木工具。难道真的是那支采...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x08CE4DAE80013823","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1028405003:2":{"text":"あれ、この切り株、なんだか変だなぁ……","source_cn":"咦，这些树桩看起来有些奇怪……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F6A447126BB8AC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1028405003":{"text":"あれ、この切り株、なんだか変だなぁ……","source_cn":"咦，这些树桩看起来有些奇怪……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F6A447126BB8AC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028405004:1":{"text":"腐敗！？私に見せてください。","source_cn":"腐化？！请让我看看。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23EF8CE030865064","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","doc